      "created_at": "2020-03-18T12:47:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not exactly sure what you're getting at. :)</p>\n<p>If your point is 5 Health is ridiculous for a villain, well, you are proposing an underpowered, fragile villain...which is essentially a minion who deserves to go down in 1-2 hits.</p>\n<p>But I also understand better now that heroes can crank out more damage than I initially thought, which is why 5*H makes sense.</p>",
